  "hooks": [
    {
      "text": "以第一人称法师视角把动作肉鸽与FPS融合",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Action Roguelite meets FPS Revenge of the Mage pulls the camera down right into the cowl of a mage so you can experience the magic and destruction in person!",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2287150/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "不同先祖赋予独立元素能力，并持续解锁新流派",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "You have a variety of Ancestors to choose from, each with different elemental powers. You will unlock even more as you play the game, providing new styles so you can find your favorite.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2287150/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "三十多张升级卡在升级时出现，并可多次强化",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "With 30+ unique cards - we are adding more- to be offered when you level up, each of which can be upgraded several times for greater effect, every playthrough will be different.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2287150/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    }
  ],
